y changing the source artifact sent to the client.\\\"\\n    reads \\\"4\\\"\\n    writes \\\"1\\\"\\n    incoming_links \\\"1\\\"\\n    outgoing_links \\\"0\\\"\\n    retention_score \\\"6\\\"\\n    qualifiers \\\"conversation_id=issue-716|kind=message|role=user\\\"\\n    validation \\\"aligned\\\"\\n  learned_expression_06\\n    id \\\"lesson:side-effect-boundary\\\"\\n    text \\\"learning_amendment\\nassistant\\nHTTP planning must emit only advertised client capabilities; embedded execution remains restricted to explicitly local isolated surfaces.\\nlesson:typed-execution-artifact\\\"\\n    reads \\\"0\\\"\\n    writes \\\"3\\\"\\n    incoming_links \\\"0\\\"\\n    outgoing_links \\\"1\\\"\\n    retention_score \\\"4\\\"\\n    qualifiers \\\"conversation_id=issue-716|kind=learning_amendment|role=assistant\\\"\\n    validation \\\"aligned\\\"\\n  learned_expression_07\\n    id \\\"lesson:presentation-independence\\\"\\n    text \\\"learning_amendment\\nassistant\\nHuman-facing wording and localization may change without altering executable intent because protocol adapters consume the typed artifact.\\nlesson:typed-execution-artifact\\\"\\n    reads \\\"0\\\"\\n    writes \\\"2\\\"\\n    incoming_links \\\"0\\\"\\n    outgoing_links \\\"1\\\"\\n    retention_score \\\"3\\\"\\n    qualifiers \\\"conversation_id=issue-716|kind=learning_amendment|role=assistant\\\"\\n    validation \\\"aligned\\\"\\n\",\"filePath\":\"/tmp/tmp.pD3lREIg3b/client-execution-learning-report.lino\"}"}}]},{"role":"tool","tool_call_id":"call_4ddc5ed3c891ec20","content":""},{"role":"assistant","content":"Let me run the requested command to get that for you.","tool_calls":[{"id":"call_641b9f7f9c4e9fcb","type":"function","function":{"name":"bash","arguments":"{\"command\":\"cat client-execution-learning-report.lino\"}"}}]},{"role":"tool","tool_call_id":"call_641b9f7f9c4e9fcb","content":"client_execution_learning_report\n  issue \"716\"\n  decision \"awaiting_human_review\"\n  promotion_gate \"p